{#
  ConfigMap containing the Cluster Vulnerabilities Grafana dashboard JSON. The
  Grafana sidecar watches for ConfigMaps with the label grafana_dashboard: '1'
  in all namespaces (searchNamespace: ALL in prometheus-values.yml.j2) and
  provisions them automatically, so this lives in the trivy-system namespace
  with the rest of Play 4 rather than in the observability namespace.

  The dashboard reads two datasources because the two halves of the data live
  in different places. Severity counts come from Prometheus, where
  trivy-operator publishes them per workload; the CVE identifiers behind those
  counts come from Loki, where the export CronJob in trivy-report-export.yml.j2
  puts them. See that template for why the identifiers are not in Prometheus.

  Severity is spelled differently in each source and the two cannot share one
  variable: trivy-operator title-cases the value in its metric labels
  ('Critical'), while the VulnerabilityReport field the export reads is
  upper-case ('CRITICAL'). The Prometheus panels hard-code the title-case form
  and the $severity variable applies only to the Loki panel.

  Both stop at HIGH because that is where trivy.severity is set in
  trivy-operator-values.yml.j2 — MEDIUM and below are not collected, so a panel
  or a variable option for them would read as an all-clear rather than as
  absence. Widening the collected range means widening both.

  The findings panel is a logs panel rather than a table. A table would need
  the logfmt fields lifted into columns by an extractFields transformation,
  and the raw line is already one readable row per finding.

  The operator log sits in a collapsed row rather than behind a link to
  Explore. A link would have to carry the query in an encoded Explore URL,
  whose shape has changed between Grafana major versions; a panel holds the
  query as data the dashboard already owns. Collapsed, it costs one header row
  until clicked.

  That panel excludes container="export" because the export CronJob's findings
  share the namespace with the operator's own output, and there are thousands
  of them — an unfiltered namespace query is almost entirely findings. It also
  reformats to level and message, since the operator logs JSON with a full Go
  stacktrace on every error line.

  The default time range is one export interval. A wider range spans more than
  one snapshot and shows each finding repeated per export, since the export
  re-emits whatever the reports currently hold rather than only what changed.

  The datasources are referenced by the fixed uids 'prometheus' (created by the
  kube-prometheus-stack chart) and 'loki' (pinned in prometheus-values.yml.j2),
  not by name lookup, so this JSON does not break if either is renamed.

  The raw block below prevents Jinja2 from interpreting Grafana's and LogQL's
  own placeholders as template expressions.

  Variables:
    trivy_namespace: Namespace holding the Trivy Operator, the export CronJob,
                     and this ConfigMap (e.g. trivy-system).
#}
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: trivy-vulnerabilities-dashboard
  namespace: '{{ trivy_namespace }}'
  labels:
    grafana_dashboard: '1'
data:
  vulnerabilities.json: |
    {% raw %}{
      "annotations": {
        "list": [
          {
            "builtIn": 1,
            "datasource": {"type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --"},
            "enable": true,
            "hide": true,
            "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
            "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
            "type": "dashboard"
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Image vulnerabilities across every scanned workload, from Trivy Operator. Counts come from Prometheus; the CVE identifiers behind them come from Loki.",
      "editable": true,
      "graphTooltip": 1,
      "links": [],
      "panels": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {"fixedColor": "dark-red", "mode": "fixed"},
              "mappings": [],
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0},
          "id": 1,
          "options": {
            "colorMode": "value",
            "graphMode": "none",
            "justifyMode": "auto",
            "orientation": "auto",
            "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
            "textMode": "auto"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum(trivy_image_vulnerabilities{namespace=~\"$namespace\", severity=\"Critical\"})",
              "instant": true,
              "legendFormat": "Critical",
              "range": false,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Critical",
          "type": "stat"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {"fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed"},
              "mappings": [],
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0},
          "id": 2,
          "options": {
            "colorMode": "value",
            "graphMode": "none",
            "justifyMode": "auto",
            "orientation": "auto",
            "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
            "textMode": "auto"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum(trivy_image_vulnerabilities{namespace=~\"$namespace\", severity=\"High\"})",
              "instant": true,
              "legendFormat": "High",
              "range": false,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "High",
          "type": "stat"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "description": "Workload containers with a report. A workload missing here is not a workload with no findings — it is one that was never scanned, which is what a failing scan job looks like from the dashboard. The OTBR image is excluded by configuration and never appears.",
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {"fixedColor": "text", "mode": "fixed"},
              "mappings": [],
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
          "id": 4,
          "options": {
            "colorMode": "value",
            "graphMode": "none",
            "justifyMode": "auto",
            "orientation": "auto",
            "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
            "textMode": "auto"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "count(count by (namespace, resource_name, container_name) (trivy_image_vulnerabilities{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}))",
              "instant": true,
              "legendFormat": "Scanned",
              "range": false,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Workloads Scanned",
          "type": "stat"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "description": "Credentials found inside scanned images by the exposed-secret scanner. Any non-zero value is worth acting on regardless of severity.",
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {"fixedColor": "purple", "mode": "fixed"},
              "mappings": [],
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
          "id": 5,
          "options": {
            "colorMode": "value",
            "graphMode": "none",
            "justifyMode": "auto",
            "orientation": "auto",
            "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
            "textMode": "auto"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum(trivy_image_exposedsecrets{namespace=~\"$namespace\"})",
              "instant": true,
              "legendFormat": "Exposed secrets",
              "range": false,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Exposed Secrets",
          "type": "stat"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "description": "Counts move when an image is upgraded or when Trivy's vulnerability database is updated and existing images are rescanned.",
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
              "custom": {
                "drawStyle": "line",
                "fillOpacity": 10,
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "pointSize": 5,
                "showPoints": "never"
              },
              "mappings": [],
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4},
          "id": 6,
          "options": {
            "legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true},
            "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (severity) (trivy_image_vulnerabilities{namespace=~\"$namespace\"})",
              "legendFormat": "{{severity}}",
              "range": true,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Vulnerabilities Over Time",
          "type": "timeseries"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "description": "One row per workload per severity. Sort by Count to find the images carrying the most.",
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
              "custom": {"align": "auto", "cellOptions": {"type": "auto"}, "filterable": true},
              "mappings": [],
              "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "text", "value": null}]},
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 11},
          "id": 7,
          "options": {
            "footer": {"countRows": false, "fields": "", "reducer": ["sum"], "show": false},
            "showHeader": true,
            "sortBy": [{"desc": true, "displayName": "Count"}]
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "sum by (namespace, resource_name, image_repository, image_tag, severity) (trivy_image_vulnerabilities{namespace=~\"$namespace\", severity=~\"Critical|High\"})",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "range": false,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Critical and High by Workload",
          "transformations": [
            {
              "id": "organize",
              "options": {
                "excludeByName": {"Time": true},
                "indexByName": {},
                "renameByName": {
                  "Value": "Count",
                  "image_repository": "Image",
                  "image_tag": "Tag",
                  "namespace": "Namespace",
                  "resource_name": "Workload",
                  "severity": "Severity"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "type": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
          "description": "Individual findings, exported from the VulnerabilityReports on a schedule. Set $cve to a CVE identifier to find every workload carrying it. 'fixed=none' means no patched version is published yet.",
          "gridPos": {"h": 13, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20},
          "id": 8,
          "options": {
            "dedupStrategy": "none",
            "enableLogDetails": true,
            "prettifyLogMessage": false,
            "showCommonLabels": false,
            "showLabels": false,
            "showTime": true,
            "sortOrder": "Descending",
            "wrapLogMessage": true
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
              "editorMode": "code",
              "expr": "{namespace=\"{% endraw %}{{ trivy_namespace }}{% raw %}\", container=\"export\"} | logfmt | workload_namespace=~\"$namespace\" | severity=~\"$severity\" | cve=~\"(?i).*$cve.*\"",
              "queryType": "range",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Findings",
          "type": "logs"
        },
        {
          "collapsed": true,
          "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33},
          "id": 9,
          "panels": [
            {
              "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
              "description": "The operator's own log, not findings. It is quiet in normal operation — it logs at startup and on failure, not once per scan, so an empty panel over a long range is the healthy state. Scan job pods are deleted after they run, but Alloy has already shipped their output, so a failed scan's detail survives here for Loki's retention period after the pod is gone.",
              "gridPos": {"h": 11, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34},
              "id": 10,
              "options": {
                "dedupStrategy": "none",
                "enableLogDetails": true,
                "prettifyLogMessage": false,
                "showCommonLabels": false,
                "showLabels": false,
                "showTime": true,
                "sortOrder": "Descending",
                "wrapLogMessage": true
              },
              "targets": [
                {
                  "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
                  "editorMode": "code",
                  "expr": "{namespace=\"{% endraw %}{{ trivy_namespace }}{% raw %}\", container!=\"export\"} | json | line_format \"{{.level}} {{.msg}}\"",
                  "queryType": "range",
                  "refId": "A"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Operator and Server Log",
              "type": "logs"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Logs",
          "type": "row"
        }
      ],
      "refresh": "",
      "schemaVersion": 38,
      "tags": ["security", "trivy"],
      "templating": {
        "list": [
          {
            "current": {},
            "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
            "definition": "label_values(trivy_image_vulnerabilities, namespace)",
            "hide": 0,
            "includeAll": true,
            "allValue": ".*",
            "label": "Namespace",
            "multi": true,
            "name": "namespace",
            "options": [],
            "query": {"query": "label_values(trivy_image_vulnerabilities, namespace)", "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"},
            "refresh": 2,
            "regex": "",
            "sort": 1,
            "type": "query"
          },
          {
            "current": {"selected": true, "text": ["CRITICAL", "HIGH"], "value": ["CRITICAL", "HIGH"]},
            "hide": 0,
            "includeAll": true,
            "allValue": ".*",
            "label": "Severity",
            "multi": true,
            "name": "severity",
            "options": [],
            "query": "CRITICAL,HIGH",
            "type": "custom"
          },
          {
            "current": {"text": "", "value": ""},
            "hide": 0,
            "label": "CVE",
            "name": "cve",
            "options": [],
            "query": "",
            "type": "textbox"
          }
        ]
      },
      "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
      "timepicker": {},
      "timezone": "browser",
      "title": "Cluster Vulnerabilities",
      "uid": "vulnerabilities",
      "version": 1
    }{% endraw %}
